  "text": "Mage Melee Ent\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Magic / Melee preset\n\nRole Information\nMage/Melee should be limited to only free(sc) or hammer roles as well as only 1 per team for optimal performance. It provides strong damage for p1-3 and zaros but woll not attack minions p3 and severely lacks pillar damage.\nRotation\nPrefight\nAt :   + s \n​\nIn Instance on  → : (Release stall asap)  +  → s → () →  →  →  / \n​\nPhase 1\ns  / s  → tc  + r  / r  +  →  →  → \n​\nNote: TC  at 6 seconds on the boss timer\n​\nPhase 2 and 3\n →  +  →  →  →  →  →   →  →  →   →  →  +  →  →  (improv if not phased) + \n​\nNote:  should be cast 1 tick before amalgamations spawn, can also optionally stall  and release with \n​\nPillars\n1st Pillar s → r + \n2nd Pillar  →  → \n3rd Pillar  →  →  → ()\n4th Pillar  → \n​\nZaros\n  →   →  → improv if not dead\n​\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nExample Kills\n\n30/07/2023 - Ghotic Fish - Link\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNex, Angel of Death\n\nThis guide is made and upkept in collaboration with the Nex, Angel of Death discord.\n\nFor those interested in a non-toxic and friendly environment for ‘Small’ team AoD, with team sizes varying from 4 to 7. We accept all experience levels, from Learners to Experts and Teachers. We offer teams running throughout the day.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Mage Melee Ent ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Magic / Melee preset Role Information Mage/Melee should be limited to only free(sc) or hammer roles as well as only 1 per team for optimal performance. It provides strong damage for p1-3 and zaros but woll not attack minions p3 and severely lacks pillar damage. Rotation Prefight At : + s ​ In Instance on → : (Release stall asap) + → s → () → → → / ​ Phase 1 s / s → tc + r / r + → → → ​ Note: TC at 6 seconds on the boss timer ​ Phase 2 and 3 → + → → → → → → → → → → + → → (improv if not phased) + ​ Note: should be cast 1 tick before amalgamations spawn, can also optionally stall and release with ​ Pillars 1st Pillar s → r + 2nd Pillar → → 3rd Pillar → → → () 4th Pillar → ​ Zaros → → → improv if not dead ​ Example Kills 30/07/2023 - Ghotic Fish - Link Nex, Angel of Death This guide is made and upkept in collaboration with the Nex, Angel of Death discord. For those interested in a non-toxic and friendly environment for ‘Small’ team AoD, with team sizes varying from 4 to 7. We accept all experience levels, from Learners to Experts and Teachers. We offer teams running throughout the day.",
